            "value": "Open Question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offene Fragen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Questions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ohne Auswahl sucht das Update in allen abonnierten Podcasts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With nothing selected, the update searches all your subscribed podcasts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ohne Netz spielt nur, was auf diesem Gerät geladen ist. Keine Folge in „Als Nächstes“ ist geladen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without a connection, only episodes downloaded to this device can play. None of the episodes queued with \"Play Next\" are downloaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ohne Speicher weiter": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continue Without Storage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ohne Zeitmarke, nicht abspielbar": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No timestamp, can't be played"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Original %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Original %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overcast, Pocket Casts und die meisten anderen Podcast-Apps exportieren ihre Abos als OPML-Datei. So kommen alle auf einmal herüber.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overcast, Pocket Casts, and most other podcast apps export their subscriptions as an OPML file. That brings them all over at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Parken": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save for Later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Passt nicht alles hinein, kommen die wichtigsten Stellen zuerst. Der Rest rückt nach, sobald du sie gehört hast.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If not everything fits, the most important passages come first. The rest moves up once you've heard them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pausieren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause"
          }
        }
      }
    },
